---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "RetroOS Museum - Home"
description: "Explore historical operating systems through an interactive modular builder"
bodyClass: "home-page"
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Welcome to RetroOS Museum</h1>
  <p>Explore the evolution of operating systems through an interactive modular builder.</p>
</section>

<section class="features">
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Modular OS component system</li>
    <li>Historical OS recreations</li>
    <li>Interactive demonstrations</li>
    <li>Educational resource</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="os-preview">
  <h2>Operating Systems</h2>
  {% if collections.operatingSystems.length > 0 %}
    <ul>
      {% for os in collections.operatingSystems %}
        <li><a href="{{ os.url }}">{{ os.data.title }}</a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% else %}
    <p>OS collection coming soon...</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
